	(text "Rev 1 controls: I2C 0x20, polled; INT unused. R48, R49, R52-R55 bias the inputs high.\nP2 GNSS_RESET_N, P3 GNSS_SAFEBOOT_N: high-Z by default, firmware drives them low only; D15, D16 block a high level.\nJ12 pins 1 and 2 unused. J12: dry contacts to GND only."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
